WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.380
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.960
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.170
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.470
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.560
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.720
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.720
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.730
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.060
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.320
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.900
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:34.910
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.950
<b>Gatz</b>

31
00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.840
H-He did it!

32
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.180
He really took down Doflamingo!

33
00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:10.500
He did it!

34
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.850
Dressrosa is saved!

35
00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.970
By a rubber ball!

36
00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:17.840
No, he isn't just some rubber ball.

37
00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.460
According to King Riku, he is...

38
00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:25.160
the pirate Straw Hat Luffy!

39
00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.620
Thank you, Straw Hat!

40
00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.180
No, wait a minute...

41
00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:36.800
His face looks scarier, and his body's rounder than the guy in the newspaper.

42
00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.660
Is that really him?

43
00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:48.460
Are you Straw Hat Luffy?

44
00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.680
Huh? Yeah.

45
00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.840
I heard he's like an eight-meter tall monster.

46
00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.940
This guy's four meters at most.

47
00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.940
Then he's a fake?

48
00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:02.220
Hey, rubber ball. Are you really the Straw Hat?

49
00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.560
You guys're bugging me!

50
00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:06.360
Why do you keep bouncing up and down?

51
00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.280
Can't you stop?

52
00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.240
Nope.

53
00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:14.380
Hey, what was that?
I just heard something loud!

54
00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.400
Viola?

55
00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.120
Straw Hat...

56
00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.020
...won!

57
00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:22.860
Really?!

58
00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:32.120
Amazing!

59
00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:36.920
What destructive strength!
There's no way he's still alive!

60
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.410
Hey. Look up, in the sky!

61
00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:52.620
No good!

62
00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.960
The bird cage isn't gone!

63
00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.280
Dammit! Just one more strike!

64
00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:40.280
Rubber...

65
00:04:57.510 --> 00:05:00.040
Hey, what's the matter, Straw Hat Luffy?

66
00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.820
Jesus Burgess!
Why was he here at the Palace?!

67
00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:27.410
You're kidding me!

68
00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.680
He jumped down!
I can't believe how far he can jump!

69
00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.720
Hello, Sabo-kun?

70
00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.720
Come in! Hello?!

71
00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.720
That Straw Hat bastard's half-dead!

72
00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.480
Now's my chance!

73
00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:49.340
That's...

74
00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:56.000
The captain of the first ship of
Emperor Blackbeard's pirate crew...

75
00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.960
"Champion" Burgess!

76
00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.940
Just you wait!

77
00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.980
I'll kill you, then rob you of...

78
00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:09.620
the Rubber Fruit!

79
00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.570
Are you okay?

80
00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:16.460
Don't!

81
00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.880
Don't just walk right up to him. He's a pirate too!

82
00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.020
You never know what they're thinking.

83
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:30.120
What a terrible thing to say!
He fought Doflamingo for us!

84
00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.810
She's right!

85
00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.740
At the very least, he's not our enemy.

86
00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:37.240
Still, I can't trust him!

87
00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.560
But...

88
00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:42.760
King Riku told us that he's our only hope!

89
00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:46.480
Hey, you! Is the battle over?

90
00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.160
What happened to Doflamingo?

91
00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:23.880
Doflamingo is still alive!

92
00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.870
Get away from the town!

93
00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.800
The fight between the pirates is still going on!

94
00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:34.650
We're gonna get caught up in it! Get outta here!

95
00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.740
Even downtown's in danger!

96
00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:40.520
The bird cage is closing in!
There's no place to run!

97
00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.910
Min... go...

98
00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.450
S-Straw Hat Luffy...

99
00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.190
H-he can't fight anymore...

100
00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:25.600
If you go near him, you'll get caught up in their fight and die! Don't get involved!

101
00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.670
Get away from the pirate!

102
00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.330
Straw Hat the Pirate!

103
00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.260
Do you recognize me?

104
00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.140
I'm Gatz!

105
00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.120
The announcer from the Colosseum, Gatz!

106
00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.430
The unknown gladiator, Lucy's true identity...

107
00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.520
was you, wasn't it?

108
00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.280
Y-yeah...

109
00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.950
I thought so!

110
00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:19.130
There aren't many small guys who are that strong!

111
00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.530
Doflamingo's on his way!

112
00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.870
What are you gonna do about your duel?

113
00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.670
Is there anything I can do?

114
00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:39.370
I need ten minutes...

115
00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:49.310
After I use Bound-Man,
I can't use Haki for ten minutes afterward.

116
00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:53.290
B-Boun...

117
00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.890
I gotta keep my distance,

118
00:10:56.490 --> 00:11:00.630
but I dunno what he's
gonna do during that time.

119
00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:03.450
If I can regain my Haki,

120
00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:08.010
I'm sure I can settle this in one blow!

121
00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:12.870
Then, his horrible reign will be over?

122
00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:19.310
Hey, if we give you ten minutes,
you'll free us from the bird cage, right?!

123
00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.310
Hey, Straw Hat!

124
00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.870
I promise!

125
00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:52.770
Alright!

126
00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:56.090
Ten minutes!
We'll leave it up to you guys!

127
00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:06.430
You can count on us!
Ten minutes'll pass by in a flash!

128
00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:10.560
You better come back quick
and bring down that damn Dofla, Lucy!

129
00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:12.190
We'll hang in there!

130
00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:17.230
They're all competitors from the tournament!

131
00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:20.750
The ones who wouldn't help you earlier!

132
00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.540
Sorry, Lucy!

133
00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.550
We were blinded by greed over the bounty on your heads!

134
00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:29.440
We didn't even dream that Doflamingo could be driven into a corner!

135
00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:30.390
Sorry!

136
00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:35.050
As a token of our apology,
we'll put our trust in you and risk our lives!

137
00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.190
If we happen to beat him first, sorry!

138
00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:06.080
Thanks for everything, Mr. Heavenly Yaksha!

139
00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.250
Why don't you hang out with us for a while?

140
00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.730
Here he comes, here he comes!

141
00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.060
Kick his ass!

142
00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.730
Alright, now's our chance!

143
00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:27.260
The remaining half of you, follow me!

144
00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.260
Someone is...

145
00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.900
Die, Straw Hat!

146
00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:49.060
B-Burgess?!

147
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:13.940
Sabo!

148
00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.710
Th-That guy...

149
00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.930
Oh, the three-star outlaw!

150
00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.180
Wh-What?!

151
00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:29.640
The Revolutionary Army's Chief of Staff!

152
00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.060
I am Sabo of the Revolutionary Army!

153
00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.840
Straw Hat Luffy is my little brother!

154
00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.150
Something you want from him, Burgess?

155
00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.580
Straw Hat is your brother?

156
00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.720
I've heard that somewhere before.

157
00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.820
Fire Fist Ace said the same thing, didn't he?
The three of us are brothers.

158
00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:12.760
After the duel on Banaro Island,
you, the Blackbeard Pirates, captured Ace.

159
00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:17.460
That was the trigger for that damnable Paramount War.

160
00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:23.480
Ace lived his own life the way he chose to.
I'm not holding a grudge against you or anything...

161
00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:27.080
but I'm watching Luffy's back from now on!

162
00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.880
Remember that!

163
00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:35.840
I have no interest in your relationship to him!

164
00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:39.680
Don't get in my way. I've got no business with you or the Revolutionary Army!

165
00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:45.040
I only have business with...

166
00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:51.540
No business with me? Not even personally?

167
00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:05.000
I see. That was you.

168
00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.620
Huh? Flame?

169
00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:10.300
Hey, Luffy.

170
00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.600
You've taken some real damage.

171
00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:17.480
Doflamingo's on his way,
and I think my hands'll be full with Burgess.

172
00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.100
I'll be fine.

173
00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.510
Cats and the others will buy me some time.

174
00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:25.590
It's Gatz!

175
00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:28.020
I'll take down Mingo, no matter what!

176
00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.570
You've become so dependable!

177
00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.790
Leave this one to me!

178
00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:33.840
Sabo.

179
00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.280
You ate Ace's Fruit, didn't you?

180
00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.610
I wouldn't let anybody else have it.
It's a memento of him!

181
00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.460
That's great!

182
00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.960
I'll be taking that power!

183
00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.450
Take care of him, Pets!

184
00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.580
It's Gatz, and I will!

185
00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.210
Galleon...

186
00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:02.080
Lariat!

187
00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.700
Burning Dragon Claw Fist!

188
00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:34.060
So hot!

189
00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.480
Flame Dragon King!

190
00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:55.530
C-Can't believe it! He blew away a subordinate of one of the Four Emperors!

191
00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:58.960
Powerful! That's what I'd expect from the Revolutionary Army's second-in-command!

192
00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:06.460
As soon as he saw the Flame Fruit's power,
he changed his focus to me.

193
00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.920
So his objective is...

194
00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.380
...as they say.

195
00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.590
He's hunting down Devil Fruit users.

196
00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:18.690
Hey, Lucy! What gives?

197
00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:22.000
I thought you won the competition
and took the Flame Fruit...

198
00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:25.040
The Lucy in the finals wasn't me.

199
00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:29.850
I had somewhere to be, so Sabo took my place.

200
00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:32.910
Oh, so that's what happened.
That's against the rules!

201
00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:35.740
But it all worked out, yeah.

202
00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.420
Inheriting your late brother's ability makes for an exciting story.

203
00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:40.860
Well, whatever!

204
00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:45.760
In any case, your recovery is
the only hope Dressrosa has left!

205
00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:25.600
What's with that bastard?
He still has the energy to do this?

206
00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.240
Don't hesitate!
We gotta stall him as much as we can!

207
00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:39.130
Annoying weaklings!
I don't need any energy to wipe you out!

208
00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:41.260
Show yourself, Straw Hat!

209
00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.820
I'll make you regret everything.

210
00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.960
Straw Hat!

211
00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:10.560
That bastard, Doflamingo!
He'll go to any length!

212
00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.670
What else is he gonna do?!

213
00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:15.800
First he made the bird cage, and now he's turning the town into strings!

214
00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:18.100
Dressrosa is done for!

215
00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:26.060
Just run! The only way to survive
is to get away from the downtown area!

216
00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:30.340
The whole area's a war zone!
If you get caught up in it, you're dead meat!

217
00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.720
I'm not gonna get cut up by that bird cage crap!

218
00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:41.120
Hurry toward the downtown area!

219
00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.430
Hey, don't push!

220
00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.400
Watch out! I'm gonna get crushed!

221
00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.280
I have children!

222
00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.030
Stop! Stop!

223
00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:57.110
Hey, why're you running in the opposite direction?! We gotta get to the downtown area!

224
00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.260
Downtown's a war zone now!

225
00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:00.120
What?!

226
00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:11.290
What? Then...

227
00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.160
Where do we run?!

228
00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:19.080
King Riku, what are we supposed to do?

229
00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.720
Armament...

230
00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:51.330
What are you doing, Zoro-dono?
Trying to stop it with your swords?!

231
00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.940
It is not something you can stop by merely pushing!

232
00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:55.280
How would you know?

233
00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:02.580
If you have time to jabber on that it's impossible, then gimme a hand, you slow-ass idiots!

234
00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.900
It's just one person's ability!

235
00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:09.280
There's no real reason for me to believe I can't stop it!

236
00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:11.840
Shall we, Kin'emon?

237
00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:13.100
We shall!

238
00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:17.850
<b>In Front of the Smile Factory</b>

239
00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:20.100
You ready?!

240
00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:21.670
We are!

241
00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:25.300
The factory's made of Sea Stone!
It can't be damaged!

242
00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:28.380
Let me see that freakish strength of yours!

243
00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:33.500
Alright! Ready!

244
00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:38.260
Push the factory!

245
00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:47.260
Push, push!

246
00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:49.080
Push!

247
00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:52.490
Not yet, not yet! Push, push!

248
00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:54.320
Push!

249
00:22:54.540 --> 00:22:58.430
<b>Royal Palace Grounds - Level 2</b>

250
00:22:58.740 --> 00:23:01.120
Zoro and the others are pushing against the bird cage?

251
00:23:01.120 --> 00:23:01.660
Yes.

252
00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:03.840
Is it even possible to stop it?

253
00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:07.900
I don't know. I would have never thought of it.

254
00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:11.320
Roger! That's so like him.

255
00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:21.000
<b>Royal Palace Grounds
South Side</b>

256
00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:30.890
This is the will of the young master!

257
00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:32.920
What?! Get out of our way!

258
00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:41.060
How rude.

259
00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:47.590
Come no closer!
These are the New Royal Grounds!

260
00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:51.620
Only members of the Donquixote Family may enter!

261
00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:55.450
What "Family"? Even the commanders are gone!

262
00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:58.400
But this is the safest place to be! Let us climb up!

263
00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:03.740
Shut up! You damn fools are condemned criminals!

264
00:24:04.240 --> 00:24:09.820
The young master has decreed that
this country will be completely cleansed!

265
00:24:10.940 --> 00:24:12.720
Barrier...

266
00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:15.770
Pistol!

267
00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:25.200
Outta our way, left-overs!

268
00:24:28.080 --> 00:24:30.260
It's the fighters from the Colosseum!

269
00:24:30.580 --> 00:24:32.200
Bartolomeo!

270
00:24:36.340 --> 00:24:37.540
Hajrudin!

271
00:24:42.020 --> 00:24:43.380
Don Chinjao!

272
00:24:44.660 --> 00:24:46.340
Army Commander Kyros is here, too!

273
00:24:49.020 --> 00:24:51.320
How am I able to move?

274
00:24:51.320 --> 00:24:55.730
I'm wondering the same thing.
I didn't think I could move with those injuries.

275
00:24:55.730 --> 00:24:57.580
Don't let your guard down just yet!

276
00:24:58.920 --> 00:25:03.210
By decision of Princess Mansherry,
Dressrosa has been placed on life support!

277
00:25:03.210 --> 00:25:04.400
Life support?

278
00:25:04.400 --> 00:25:06.200
What do you mean, dwarf?

279
00:25:08.060 --> 00:25:11.100
In any case, everybody!
Claw your way to the plateau!

280
00:25:11.820 --> 00:25:14.590
The center of the bird cage is moving this way!

281
00:25:14.590 --> 00:25:15.830
Hooray!

282
00:25:15.830 --> 00:25:18.020
You saved us, Kyros-sama!

283
00:25:18.020 --> 00:25:20.440
Hey, men don't depend on others!

284
00:25:20.440 --> 00:25:24.440
Those of you who are able-bodied, come with us!

285
00:25:24.440 --> 00:25:27.100
Huh? "Come with me"?!

286
00:25:31.760 --> 00:25:33.430
Hey, where're ya going?!

287
00:25:33.430 --> 00:25:34.930
Doflamingo!

288
00:25:34.930 --> 00:25:39.400
If he's not gonna come out,
I'm gonna make him come out!

289
00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:03.740
Hey, that's...

290
00:26:05.260 --> 00:26:07.080
Isn't it moving faster than before?!

291
00:26:07.720 --> 00:26:08.850
No doubt about it!

292
00:26:08.850 --> 00:26:12.240
The bird cage is closing in even faster!

293
00:26:20.700 --> 00:26:23.400
Please save us, Your Majesty!

294
00:26:23.400 --> 00:26:25.160
We're not gonna make it!

295
00:26:27.760 --> 00:26:30.860
Stop it, Doflamingo!

296
00:26:34.980 --> 00:26:36.520
We won't make it!

297
00:26:36.520 --> 00:26:39.240
Push! Put more power into it!

298
00:26:45.080 --> 00:26:46.380
Come on!

299
00:26:56.930 --> 00:27:00.960
Push!

300
00:27:02.660 --> 00:27:03.920
What's the matter?

301
00:27:05.620 --> 00:27:07.400
We're being pushed back!

302
00:27:07.400 --> 00:27:10.180
It's speeding up... Don't let it get the better of you!

303
00:27:10.180 --> 00:27:12.930
Push harder than you've ever pushed before!

304
00:27:12.930 --> 00:27:13.680
Okay!

305
00:27:14.580 --> 00:27:18.540
Push!

306
00:27:18.940 --> 00:27:21.950
Alright, now's our chance to show off!

307
00:27:21.950 --> 00:27:23.920
Yeah!

308
00:27:36.140 --> 00:27:39.340
Come on out, Straw Hat...

309
00:27:44.160 --> 00:27:45.460
Help us!

310
00:27:45.460 --> 00:27:48.200
Hurry! It's shrinking faster!

311
00:27:51.800 --> 00:27:58.480
Three minutes remain until the bird cage reaches the downtown area and the blood bath begins.

312
00:27:58.700 --> 00:28:00.500
You've gotta be kidding!

313
00:28:00.500 --> 00:28:02.420
We won't make it in time!

314
00:28:02.800 --> 00:28:06.300
Four minutes remain until
Luffy's Haki is regained.

315
00:28:06.740 --> 00:28:12.100
This leaves a one minute difference between the moment the bird cage closes completely
and the moment Luffy awakens.
